# React Patterns

## Components

- Use functional components only.
- Colocate UI in `components/` by feature (e.g. `tenders/`, `company/`, `admin/`).
- Use shadcn/ui components from `components/ui/`; extend with `cn()` for conditional classes.

## Data & Hooks

- Server state: TanStack Query. Use hooks from `hooks/` (e.g. `useDashboard`, `useTenders`, `useProfile`).
- API calls: Prefer `lib/api/client.ts` and existing hooks; invalidate queries in `onSuccess` for mutations.
- Auth: `useAuth()` from context; check `hydrated` before redirecting.

## New Pages

- Protected pages live under `app/(protected)/...`.
- Add nav in `components/layout/Header.tsx` when adding a new main section.

## Forms

- Prefer react-hook-form with Zod resolvers where forms are non-trivial; keep validation in sync with API schemas.
